robbery-390-392.l4:1133:1-76:
  "A charge under section 392 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of robbery (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: in all robbery there is either theft or extortion (section 390(1)); neither the aggravation that makes a theft robbery (section 390(2)) nor the one that makes an extortion robbery (section 390(3))."
